{"ID":"20240205153812-g30wtgv","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153812-g30wtgv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153812-g30wtgv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206084412-xk0emjx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613094249-fytt4m4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:10000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240629144333-h5ivi55\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:64,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:64\u0026#125;","title":"287大戟","type":"doc","updated":"20240823114444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206084412-xk0emjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084412-xk0emjx","updated":"20240629101202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"红大戟（红芽大戟）"}]},{"ID":"20240206084434-roegok9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084434-roegok9","updated":"20240206084437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、云南、福建等地。\n【性状】\t块根呈长圆锥形或长纺锤形，多不分枝，稍弯曲，长312cm，直径0.61.2cm。表面棕红色或灰棕色，有扭曲的纵皱纹；顶端可见茎痕。质坚实而易折断，断面皮部红褐色，木部棕黄色。气微，味微辛。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t泻水逐饮；解毒散结。用于胸腹积水，二便不利，痈肿疮毒，瘰疬痰核。"}]},{"ID":"20240206084427-wffbx3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084427-wffbx3a","updated":"20240206084427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206084427-sioead9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629094308-0psckem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629094308-0psckem","updated":"20240629101945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 375px;","style":"width: 365px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"Node