","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20cm，直径可达4cm，表面灰棕色至深棕色，粗糙而具侧根，顶端多膨大，上有许多圆形的地上茎痕，向下渐细，有纵直沟纹及横生皮孔与支根痕。质坚硬，不易折断，折断面纤维性，类白色至灰棕色。气微，味苦涩。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t泻水逐饮。用于水肿胀满，胸腹积水，痰饮积聚，气逆喘咳，二便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085416-fyhd221","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085416-fyhd221","updated":"20240206085416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085416-rz1g8a9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160542-38h9bxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160542-38h9bxx","updated":"20240206084401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"京大戟"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/京大戟-20240205160542-ptya1v1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160542-pton2tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160542-pton2tb","updated":"20240205160542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"京大戟2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/京大戟2-20240205160542-mt8pdjs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629091845-tp9zco5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629091845-tp9zco5","updated":"20240823113426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 471px;","style":"width: 461px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"Nod